y strange, and decided to investigate Lordleon with Locke's help.\n\n(Source: Official Site)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pirates","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Locke the Superman: Lord Leon","english":"Locke the Superman: Lord Leon","native":"超人ロック ロードレオン","romaji":"Choujin Locke: Lord Leon","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"超人ロック～ロードレオン～"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"超人洛克 Lord Leon"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Choujin Locke: Lordleon"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}